  "source_contract_notes": [
    "memory.py and sync-memory.py anchor REPO to implementation parent.parent before local imports.",
    "Root Python shims execute implementation in the same module globals, retaining patchable globals and canonical top-level module names; __file__ and traceback filename name the real implementation.",
    "Root PS1 parameters/defaults forward unchanged. New implementation resolves config from repository root and invokes scripts/sync-memory.py; LASTEXITCODE is forwarded.",
    "Direct CLI path and old compatibility CLI path must agree on args, cwd-independent roots, output and exit code. No online/memory access is required to check help, rejected writes, NONE or unknown mode.",
    "Known existing P2 fixture copies root files only; its candidate patch adds six scripts implementations and creates destination parents."
